ass="inline-block motion-safe:animate-[bk-tick_var(--bk-duration-base)_ease-out]">--</span></span></div></div></div><form id="direct-order" noValidate="" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-bk-md pt-bk-xs"><div data-layer="form" data-layer-label="Order form"><h2 aria-live="polite" class="font-bk-display text-[17px] font-black leading-snug text-bk-ink text-left"><span class="block motion-safe:animate-[bk-fade-up_var(--bk-duration-base)_ease-out_both]">Start with your mobile number</span></h2><div class="mt-bk-sm text-left"><label for="_R_0_-phone" class="mb-1 block font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink-soft">Phone number <span class="font-normal text-bk-ink-faint">(WhatsApp preferred)</span></label><div class="relative"><input type="tel" required="" dir="ltr" inputMode="tel" autoComplete="tel-national" enterKeyHint="next" placeholder="0770 123 4567" class="h-[52px] w-full rounded-bk-input border-bk border-bk-divider bg-bk-surface px-4 font-bk-body text-bk-ink placeholder:text-bk-ink-faint transition-colors duration-bk-fast focus-visible:border-bk-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus aria-[invalid=true]:border-bk-danger motion-reduce:transition-none pr-10 text-left tabular-nums text-[17px] font-bold tracking-wide" id="_R_0_-phone" name="phone" value=""/></div><p data-capture-consent="" data-i18n-field="capture_consent_i18n" class="mt-1 font-bk-body text-xs text-bk-ink-faint">We may message you on WhatsApp about your order</p></div><div data-stage="name" data-open="false" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:0fr"><div class="-mx-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="space-y-bk-sm px-1 pb-1 pt-bk-sm"><div class="transition-[opacity,transform] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-1 opacity-0 text-left"><label for="_R_0_-customer_name" class="mb-1 block font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink-soft">Your name</label><div class="relative"><input type="text" required="" dir="auto" autoComplete="name" enterKeyHint="next" class="h-[52px] w-full rounded-bk-input border-bk border-bk-divider bg-bk-surface px-4 font-bk-body text-base text-bk-ink placeholder:text-bk-ink-faint transition-colors duration-bk-fast focus-visible:border-bk-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus aria-[invalid=true]:border-bk-danger motion-reduce:transition-none text-left pr-10" id="_R_0_-customer_name" name="name" value=""/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-stage="address" data-open="false" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:0fr"><div class="-mx-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden" inert=""><div class="space-y-bk-sm px-1 pb-1 pt-bk-sm"><div class="transition-[opacity,transform] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-1 opacity-0"><p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bk-display text-[15px] font-black text-bk-ink"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg text-bk-ink-soft" aria-hidden="true">local_shipping</span>Where should we deliver?</p></div><div class="transition-[opacity,transform] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-1 opacity-0 text-left"><label for="_R_0_-governorate_code" class="mb-1 block font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink-soft">Governorate</label><div class="relative"><select name="governorate" required="" autoComplete="address-level1" class="h-[52px] w-full rounded-bk-input border-bk border-bk-divider bg-bk-surface px-4 font-bk-body text-base text-bk-ink placeholder:text-bk-ink-faint transition-colors duration-bk-fast focus-visible:border-bk-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus aria-[invalid=true]:border-bk-danger motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none text-left pr-10" id="_R_0_-governorate_code"><option value="" disabled=