 w-[4.5rem] flex-col items-center gap-1 text-center"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[60px] w-[60px] rounded-bk-pill object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-2.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-2.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-2.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><span class="font-bk-body text-xs font-bold leading-tight text-bk-ink">اللافندر</span></li></ul></li><li data-stage="base" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-3"><p class="w-20 shrink-0 text-left"><span class="block font-bk-display text-sm font-black text-bk-ink">Base</span><span class="block font-bk-body text-xs font-semibold text-bk-ink-soft">what stays with you</span></p><ul class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-start gap-3"><li data-note-photo="" class="flex w-[4.5rem] flex-col items-center gap-1 text-center"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[60px] w-[60px] rounded-bk-pill object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-3.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-3.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-3.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><span class="font-bk-body text-xs font-bold leading-tight text-bk-ink">الباتشولي الساحر</span></li></ul></li></ol><div data-scent-quote=""><p class="font-bk-body text-xs font-bold text-bk-ink-soft text-left">Staying power, in a customer’s words</p><figure class="mt-1.5 flex items-start gap-2.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-bk-pill bg-bk-secondary font-bk-display text-[13px] font-black text-bk-on-secondary">س</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-bk-card bg-bk-surface px-3 py-2.5 text-left"><blockquote class="font-bk-body text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-bk-ink"><p>«بخيت منه الصبح لسه الريحة تفوح»</p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bk-body text-xs font-bold text-bk-ink-soft"><bdi>eng. سيف</bdi><span role="img" aria-label="5 / 5" class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" fill="var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a)"><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.4 5.9.8-4.3 4.1 1.1 5.9L10 14.9l-5.3 2.8 1.1-5.9L1.5 7.7l5.9-.8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" fill="var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a)"><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.4 5.9.8-4.3 4.1 1.1 5.9L10 14.9l-5.3 2.8 1.1-5.9L1.5 7.7l5.9-.8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" fill="var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a)"><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.4 5.9.8-4.3 4.1 1.1 5.9L10 14.9l-5.3 2.8 1.1-5.9L1.5 7.7l5.9-.8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" fill="var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a)"><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.4 5.9.8-4.3 4.1 1.1 5.9L10 14.9l-5.3 2.8 1.1-5.9L1.5 7.7l5.9-.8z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true" fill="var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a)"><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.4 5.9.8-4.3 4.1 1.1 5.9L10 14.9l-5.3 2.8 1.1-5.9L1.5 7.7l5.9-.8z"></path></svg></span></figcaption></div></figure></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-bk-divider pt-1"><p data-scent-rating="text" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink-soft"><span role="img" aria-label="4.7 / 5" class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true" fill="var(--bk-accent, #ffd84a)"><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.4 5.9.8-4.3 4.1 1.1 5.9L10 14.9l-5.3 2.8 1.1-5.9L1.5 7.7l5.9-.8z"></path></svg></span><bdi class="font-black tabular-nums text-bk-ink">4.7</bdi><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>6 reviews</span></p><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1 font-bk-body text-sm font-black text-bk-ink"><span>The scent’s story</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span></button><dialog aria-labelledby="_R_ba7_" class="m-0 mt-auto max-h-[85dvh] w-full max-w-none overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain rounded-t-bk-card bg-bk-surface p-0 text-bk-ink backdrop:bg-bk-ink/60 motion-safe:animate-[bk-fade-up_var(--bk-duration-base)_ease-out_both]"><div class="px-4 pb-6 pt-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="_R_ba7_" class="font-bk-display text-base font-black text-left">The scent’s story</h2><button type="button" aria-label="Close" class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-bk-pill focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">close</span></button></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-scent-story="" class="space-y-bk-sm"><p class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bk-ink [unicode-bidi:plaintext] text-left">ملك العطور الجديد: ويفر انتنس</p><p class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bk-ink [unicode-bidi:plaintext] text-left">شايف شعور من شخص يدخل لمناسبة أو يطب للدوام، وتشوف عطره طاغي ومميز؟ هذا بالضبط اللي راح تحس بيه ويا ويفر: أكثر عطر راح تنسأل عليه من ترشه، وأكثر عطر راح يجيبلك مديح.</p><p class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bk-ink [unicode-bidi:plaintext] text-left">إحنا ما نبيعلك مجرد «ريحة حلوة». هذا العطر مصمم للرجل اللي يريد يترك «بصمة» بالمكان اللي يدخله، بثباته وفوحانه اللي يدخل قبلك للمكان ويظل وراك بعد ما تطلع. انسى العطور اللي تختفي ورا 10 دقايق.</p><p class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bk-ink [unicode-bidi:plaintext] text-left">شراح تحس من ترشه؟
أول رشة: التوت الفاخر والتفاح الأخضر. نكهة فاكهية ومنعشة تخطف الانتباه فوراً.
القلب: الهيل واللافندر. رزانة وفخامة وهدوء مال رجل واثق من نفسه ويعرف شيريد.
القاعدة: الباتشولي الساحر. الريحة اللي تتشبع بملابسك وتخلي الناس تنتبه على عطرك حتى بعد ما تطلع.</p><p class="whitespace-pre-line font-bk-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-bk-ink [unicode-bidi:plaintext] text-left">أنت تستاهل تكون مميز. لا ترضى بالعادي.</p><ul aria-label="Scent notes" class="space-y-bk-sm"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-bk-input object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-0.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-0.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-0.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><div class="min-w-0 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink">التوت البري الفاخر</p><p class="font-bk-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-bk-ink-soft">منطي العطر نكهة فاكهية اكثر من فخمة. رائحة التوت راح تخلي اي شخص يشم بيك هلعطر يسألك شنو اسمه</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-bk-input object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-1.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><div class="min-w-0 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink">الهيل الملكي</p><p class="font-bk-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-bk-ink-soft">اللمسة التوابلية اللي تنطي عطرك رزانة وطيابة مو طبيعية!</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-bk-input object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-2.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-2.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-2.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><div class="min-w-0 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink">اللافندر المهدئ</p><p class="font-bk-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-bk-ink-soft">نكهة اللافندراللي ماكو ثنين يختلفون على انو هي وحدة من اطيب الروائح الممكن تشمها بحياتك، يخلي اللي يكعد يمك يحس براحة وانجذاب بدون ما يعرف السبب.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-bk-input object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-3.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-3.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-3.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><div class="min-w-0 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink">الباتشولي الساحر</p><p class="font-bk-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-bk-ink-soft">سر الثبات المرعب! المكون اللي يكلب العطر من &quot;ريحة طيبة&quot; إلى &quot;بصمة&quot; تشبع بملابسك وتخلي عطرك يفوح لساعات طويلة.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-bk-input object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-4.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-4.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsduvpgqwhxragxtxztur.supabase.co%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Ftenant-assets%2Fstore-templates%2Fscheniders%2Fnote-cards%2Fd988d98ad981-4.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/><div class="min-w-0 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink">التفاح الأخضر المقرمش</p><p class="font-bk-body text-xs leading-relaxed text-bk-ink-soft">يكسر حدة العطر بانتعاش حامضي ومميز. يخلي ريحتك &quot;نظيفة&quot; وفرش، مثالي لأجواء الدوام الطويل أو الجامعة.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></dialog></div></section></div></section>"
`;

