lock font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink-soft">Nearest landmark <span class="font-normal text-bk-ink-faint">(optional)</span></label><input id="_R_0_-submit-error-landmark" type="text" dir="auto" autoComplete="off" enterKeyHint="done" placeholder="e.g. next to the Al-Rafidain bank" class="h-[52px] w-full rounded-bk-input border-bk border-bk-divider bg-bk-surface px-4 font-bk-body text-base text-bk-ink placeholder:text-bk-ink-faint transition-colors duration-bk-fast focus-visible:border-bk-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus aria-[invalid=true]:border-bk-danger motion-reduce:transition-none text-left" name="landmark" value=""/></div><div class="transition-[opacity,transform] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-1 opacity-0"><button type="button" class="flex min-h-11 w-full items-center gap-1.5 font-bk-body text-sm font-bold text-bk-ink-soft"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg" aria-hidden="true">add_circle</span>Add a backup number</button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-y-2" data-layer="qty" data-layer-label="Quantity and payment"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_0_-submit-error-qty-panel" class="group inline-flex h-11 items-center focus-visible:outline-none"><span class="inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-bk-pill border-bk px-3 font-bk-body text-[13px] transition-colors duration-bk-fast group-focus-visible:ring-2 group-focus-visible:ring-bk-focus group-active:bg-bk-surface-alt motion-reduce:transition-none border-bk-divider bg-bk-surface"><span class="text-bk-ink-soft">Quantity</span><span class="font-bold text-bk-ink"><bdi class="tabular-nums">1</bdi></span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-bk-ink-faint transition-transform duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true">expand_more</span></span></button><span data-payment-statement="true" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center px-1 font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink">Payment: Cash on delivery</span></div><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-bk-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none" style="grid-template-rows:0fr"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden" inert=""></div></div></div><div class="space-y-bk-sm"><div class="divide-y divide-dashed divide-bk-divider rounded-bk-card border-bk border-bk-divider px-4"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-2"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-1.5 font-bk-body text-[13px] text-bk-ink-soft"><span class="truncate">عطر ويفر انتنس الفاخر من باريس كورنر للرجال</span><bdi class="shrink-0 text-xs text-bk-ink-faint tabular-nums">× 1</bdi></span><span class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink"><bdi>25,000 IQD</bdi></span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-2"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-1.5 font-bk-body text-[13px] text-bk-ink-soft"><span class="truncate">Delivery</span></span><span class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink"><span data-delivery-fee="true"><span class="text-bk-ink">Free to every governorate</span></span></span></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-1.5 font-bk-body text-[15px] font-black text-bk-ink"><span class="truncate">Total</span></span><span class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums font-bk-display text-[22px] font-black leading-none text-bk-ink"><bdi>25,000 IQD</bdi></span></div></div><div class="flex items-stretch gap-2" data-layer="submit" data-layer-label="Order buttons"><button type="submit" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[60px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-bk-input bg-bk-primary px-5 text-bk-on-primary shadow-bk-button transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow] duration-bk-fast motion-reduce:transition-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-bk-surface disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-bk-primary-disabled disabled:shadow-none hover:bg-bk-primary-hover active:scale-[0.97] active:bg-bk-primary-active active:shadow-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-xp-sheen pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 -z-10 w-2/5"></span><span class="font-bk-display text-[19px] font-black leading-tight">Place my order</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-bk-pill bg-bk-on-primary/15"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl bk-xp-nudge" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span></button></div><div data-promise-band="true"><ul aria-label="What you get with your order" class="divide-y divide-bk-on-secondary/15 rounded-bk-card bg-bk-secondary px-4 py-1 text-bk-on-secondary"><li data-promise-row="trust" class="flex min-h-11 items-start gap-3 py-2.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-xl text-bk-primary" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-[15px] font-bold leading-snug" data-i18n-field="reassurance_i18n">Open it and try it before you pay. Tester included.</p><p class="font-bk-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-bk-on-secondary/80"><span data-i18n-field="return_promise_i18n">Don&#x27;t like it? Refuse it in front of the courier, or return it within a week.</span></p></div></li><li data-promise-row="delivery" class="flex min-h-11 items-start gap-3 py-2.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-xl text-bk-primary" aria-hidden="true">local_shipping</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-[15px] font-bold leading-snug">Delivery is free.</p><p class="font-bk-body text-[13px] leading-snug text-bk-on-secondary/80" data-i18n-field="delivery_sla_i18n">Most orders arrive within 24 hours of confirmation</p></div></li><li data-promise-row="call" class="flex min-h-11 items-start gap-3 py-2.5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-xl text-bk-primary" aria-hidden="true">call</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-1 text-left"><p class="font-bk-body text-[15px] font-bold leading-snug">You&#x27;ll get a call from <bdi class="whitespace-nowrap">0777 970 3832</bdi> to confirm your order. Answer it and your order ships.</p><a href="data:text/vcard;charset=utf-8,BEGIN%3AVCARD%0D%0AVERSION%3A3.0%0D%0AN%3AScheniders%20%E2%80%94%20order%20confirmation%3B%3B%3B%3B%0D%0AFN%3AScheniders%20%E2%80%94%20order%20confirmation%0D%0ATEL%3BTYPE%3DCELL%2CVOICE%3A%2B9647779703832%0D%0AEND%3AVCARD" download="Scheniders — order confirmation.vcf" data-save-number="true" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-bk-pill border-bk border-bk-on-secondary/40 px-3 font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-on-secondary transition-colors duration-bk-fast hover:bg-bk-on-secondary/10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-bk-focus motion-reduce:transition-none"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">person_add</span>Save our number</a></div></li></ul><p aria-live="polite" data-save-hint="true" class="mt-bk-xs text-center font-bk-body text-[13px] font-bold text-bk-ink-soft sr-only"></p></div></div></form><section data-scent-card="" aria-labelledby="_R_27_" class="space-y-bk-sm rounded-bk-card bg-bk-surface-alt p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 id="_R_27_" class="font-bk-body text-xs font-black text-bk-ink-soft">Scent profile</h2></div><ol aria-label="Scent notes" class="divide-y divide-bk-divider"><li data-stage="top" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-3"><p class="w-20 shrink-0 text-left"><span class="block font-bk-display text-sm font-black text-bk-ink">Top</span><span class="block fon